  {
    "id": "bhagavad-gita_16_1",
    "text_slug": "bhagavad-gita",
    "chapter": 16,
    "verse": 1,
    "original": "श्रीभगवानुवाच |\nअभयं सत्त्वसंशुद्धिर्ज्ञानयोगव्यवस्थितिः |\nदानं दमश्च यज्ञश्च स्वाध्यायस्तप आर्जवम् ||१६-१||",
    "transliteration": "śrībhagavānuvāca .\nabhayaṃ sattvasaṃśuddhirjñānayogavyavasthitiḥ .\ndānaṃ damaśca yajñaśca svādhyāyastapa ārjavam ||16-1||",
    "meaning": "16.1 The Blessed Lord said  Fearlessness, purity of heart, steadfastness in knowledge and Yoga, almsgiving, control of the senses, sacrifice, study of scriptures, austerity and straightforwardness.",
