  {
    "id": "bhagavad-gita_16_3",
    "text_slug": "bhagavad-gita",
    "chapter": 16,
    "verse": 3,
    "original": "तेजः क्षमा धृतिः शौचमद्रोहो नातिमानिता |\nभवन्ति सम्पदं दैवीमभिजातस्य भारत ||१६-३||",
    "transliteration": "tejaḥ kṣamā dhṛtiḥ śaucamadroho nātimānitā .\nbhavanti sampadaṃ daivīmabhijātasya bhārata ||16-3||",
    "meaning": "16.3 Vigour, forgiveness, fortitude, purity, absence of hatred, absence of pride  these belong to the one born for a divine state, O Arjuna.",
