  {
    "id": "bhagavad-gita_16_7",
    "text_slug": "bhagavad-gita",
    "chapter": 16,
    "verse": 7,
    "original": "प्रवृत्तिं च निवृत्तिं च जना न विदुरासुराः |\nन शौचं नापि चाचारो न सत्यं तेषु विद्यते ||१६-७||",
    "transliteration": "pravṛttiṃ ca nivṛttiṃ ca janā na vidurāsurāḥ .\nna śaucaṃ nāpi cācāro na satyaṃ teṣu vidyate ||16-7||",
    "meaning": "16.7 The demoniacal know not what to do and what to refrain from; neither purity, nor right conduct nor truth is found in them.",
